WEBVTT

00:21:27.346 --> 00:21:31.855
What's your prediction
about how this is received

00:21:31.879 --> 00:21:33.394
by Chinese citizens,

00:21:33.418 --> 00:21:34.950
as this is rolled out?

00:21:35.624 --> 00:21:37.823
KFL: We're still in the very early stages,

00:21:37.847 --> 00:21:40.021
so it's kind of hard to tell.

00:21:40.045 --> 00:21:46.186
So if you imagine that Equifax,
as a credit-scoring system in the US,

00:21:46.210 --> 00:21:49.781
is now run by the government,
not by a private company.

00:21:49.805 --> 00:21:51.541
Which, by the way, is a good thing,

00:21:51.565 --> 00:21:55.727
because people trust the government
more than a private company in China.

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:58.460
And on top of the credit score,

00:21:58.484 --> 00:22:01.741
not only would it be a part
of the determination